    {"type":"options","chapter":"The decision","say":"We weighed three routes. The decision: one central service built on CUPS.","data":{"options":[{"title":"Raw port 9100","icon":"plug","at":"weighed"},{"title":"Windows print server","icon":"server","at":"three"},{"title":"CUPS + IPP","icon":"queue","chosen":true,"at":"routes"}],"decide_at":"decision","headline":"One central service","headline_at":"central","drops":[{"text":"Windows spooler","at":"built"}]}},
    {"type":"pipeline","chapter":"Architecture","say":"labOS sends a PDF to the gateway, the gateway hands it to CUPS, and CUPS prints over IPP.","data":{"title":"The whole picture","stations":[{"title":"labOS","icon":"cloud","chips":["Screens"],"at":"labOS"},{"title":"Print Gateway","icon":"gate","hero":true,"code":"POST /print","at":"gateway"},{"title":"CUPS server","icon":"queue","at":"CUPS"},{"title":"Printers","icon":"printer","at":"prints"}],"links":[{"label":"HTTP"},{"label":"lp","mono":true},{"label":"IPP","at":"IPP"}],"helpers":[{"text":"ippfix (setup aid)","link":2}]}},
    {"type":"decision","chapter":"Inside labOS","say":"HtmlPrinter asks one question: is the gateway configured? If yes, it renders a PDF and uploads it. If not, nothing changes.","data":{"source":{"title":"HtmlPrinter","icon":"cloud","at":"HtmlPrinter"},"question":"Gateway configured?","at":"question","conditions":[{"text":"Containerized site","at":"configured"}],"yes":[{"text":"HTML","doc":true,"at":"yes"},{"text":"HTML to PDF service","at":"renders"},{"text":"PDF","doc":true,"badge":"%PDF ok","at":"PDF"}],"detail":{"title":"POST /print","at":"uploads","sections":[{"label":"Form fields","chips":["printer","file","copies"]},{"label":"Headers","rows":[{"code":"X-Labos-Print-Token","tag":"optional for now"}]}]},"no":{"text":"Existing print path","tag":"unchanged","at":"nothing"}}},
    {"type":"steps","chapter":"Inside the gateway","say":"The gateway caps the size, writes a temp file, runs one lp command, and replies submitted.","data":{"component":{"title":"labOS Print Gateway","icon":"gate"},"input":{"label":"PDF","at":"gateway"},"steps":[{"text":"Size cap","at":"caps"},{"text":"Token check","state":"off","note":"off by default"},{"text":"Temp file","at":"temp"},{"text":"Submitted","at":"submitted"}],"code":{"label":"One command","lines":["lp -d <queue> -t <title>","   -o media=A4 [-n <copies>]"],"at":"command","args":[{"text":"printer queue"},{"text":"paper size"}]},"result":{"text":"200 submitted","at":"replies"},"footnote":{"text":"Also accepts: file_url, s3_key"}}},
    {"type":"cards","chapter":"Turning it on","say":"Turning it on is configuration: a containerized site, a gateway address, and one queue per printer.","data":{"title":"Configuration, not code","cards":[{"num":"1","title":"Containerized site","toggle":true,"code":["CONTAINERIZED = true"],"at":"containerized"},{"num":"2","title":"Gateway address","code":["PDF_PRINTER_ADDRESS = host:port","PDF_PRINTER_TOKEN = optional"],"tags":["Autolims.cfg"],"at":"address"},{"num":"3","title":"One queue per printer","text":"Named like the printer labOS already uses.","at":"queue"}],"footer":{"text":"Rollback: configuration only"}}},
    {"type":"states","chapter":"Security","say":"The access token is optional today. Enforce it later, and only token holders can send print jobs.","data":{"subject":"Token enforcement","from":{"label":"Today","tag":"Optional today","at":"optional"},"to":{"label":"When enforced","lock":true,"text":"Only token holders can send print jobs","note":"switch on + give each labOS component the token","at":"Enforce"}}},
    {"type":"metrics","chapter":"Proof","say":"On the test bench: seven hundred jobs, zero failures, and about sixty milliseconds to accept a job.","data":{"badge":{"text":"Real paper, real office printer"},"stats":[{"value":700,"label":"jobs","at":"seven"},{"value":15,"label":"emulated printers","sub":"5 needing rendering"},{"value":0,"label":"failures","hero":true,"at":"zero"}],"bars":[{"title":"Average time to accept a job","at":"sixty","rows":[{"label":"CUPS + IPP","value":62.1,"display":"62.1 ms"},{"label":"Windows spooler + SumatraPDF","value":3360,"display":"3.36 s"}]}],"chips":[{"text":"{n} lines of tests","count":8504}],"footnote":{"text":"Test bench: 15 emulated printers. Time to accept a job, not print time."}}},
    {"type":"code","chapter":"Under the hood","say":"Under the hood it is a single command, with the queue, the title and the paper size.","data":{"title":"One command does the printing","file":"internal/cups/lp.go","lines":["lp -d <queue>","   -t <title>","   -o media=A4","   [-n <copies>]"],"highlights":[{"line":1,"at":"queue"},{"line":3,"at":"paper"}]}},
