    {"type":"statement","chapter":"Availability","say":"It ships in labOS 5.44 for containerized deployments. Other sites stay unchanged.","data":{"eyebrow":"Ships in","big":"labOS 5.44","sub":"Containerized deployments","icon":"container","at":"ships","chips":[{"text":"Other sites: unchanged","at":"Other"},{"text":"Label printing: not included","tone":"neutral"}]}},
    {"type":"recap","chapter":"Recap","say":"To remember: one central service prints every PDF. For example, a report from a container site just prints. It is traceable, so support finds a job by its ID. And it is configuration only, so rollback is one setting.","data":{"items":[{"title":"One central service","example":"A container site's report just prints","who":"Developers","at":"central","example_at":"report"},{"title":"Traceable end to end","example":"Support finds a job by its ID","who":"Support","at":"traceable","example_at":"support"},{"title":"Rollback is configuration","example":"Switch one setting to go back","who":"PMs","at":"configuration","example_at":"setting"}]}},
